{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"共尾函子"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"共尾函子"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>共尾函子是不改变"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":"的指标代换, 即对于共尾函子 $f\\colon I\\to J$ 以及图表 $X\\colon J\\to \\mathcal C$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_{i\\in I}X_{f(i)}\\to \\operatorname{colim}_{j\\in J}X_j\r\n$$\n为等价.</p>\n"}]}}